[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0010","text":"古今东西！\n在家里零食时间出现会很高兴的点心名字——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0020","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0030","text":"松饼！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0040","text":"甜甜圈！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0050","text":"泡芙！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0060","text":"铜锣烧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0070","text":"啊啊，和风点心也很棒呢……！\n──那我要蕨饼！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0080","text":"……──差不多该结束了吧\n那么最后──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0090","text":"巧克力！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21000100_01_0100","text":"啊哈哈哈哈"}]
